              <p class="0"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">2026</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">학년도 후기 대학원 신입생 모집을 아래와 같이 안내 드립니다</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">.</span></p>
<p class="0"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">(We would like to inform you of the recruitment of new graduate students for the Fall semester of 2026 as follows.)</span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="0"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">- </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">원서모집</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">(Applying Online): 2026. 6. 4.(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">목</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">) ~ 6. 18.(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">목</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">) 18:00</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">까지</span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="0"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">- </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">서류 제출 기간</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">(Submission): 2026. 6. 4.(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">목</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">) ~ 6. 19.(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">금</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">) 18:00</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">까지</span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="0"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">- </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">전공구술 및 면접고사</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">(Oral Examinations and Interviews): 2026. 7. 8.(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">수</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">) 09:00 ~</span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="0"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">- </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">합격자 발표</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">(Announcement of Successful Applicants): 2026. 7. 20.(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">월</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">) 14:00</span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="0"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">- </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">등록금 납부</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">(Fees Payment Deadline): 2026. 7. 28.(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">화</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">) ~ 7. 30.(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">목</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">) </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">매일 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">09:00 ~ 16:00</span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">자세한 내용은 첨부된 모집요강을 참고하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">.</span></p>
<p class="0"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">(Please refer to the attached recruitment notice for further details.)</span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="0"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
